1) For two adjacent cells, increase one by $2$ and increase the other by $1$;
2) For two cells with a shared vertex, increase one by $1$ and increase the other by $1$;

a) Can all cells be made equal in value using these operations?

b) Can all cells be made to contain the number $2$ using these operations?

